pe\":\"flame\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":-111,\"y\":-231,\"brief\":\"昏红光线映着焦色构架，余烬般的微光在机关缝隙间明灭。这里适合呈现情绪燃尽后的余温与未散执念。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"dreamcore-kuro-2\",\"name\":\"怡心域\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"sun\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":-308,\"y\":258,\"brief\":\"光色明暖的心域，廊台间映出令人安心的景象，细微机声也像轻缓乐音；廊台与乐音共同营造平静的景象。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"dreamcore-kuro-3\",\"name\":\"凄心域\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"rain\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":262,\"y\":113,\"brief\":\"冷光落在空阔廊道上，远处回声似断续低泣。零散景象容易唤起离别与失落，但不能直接当作真实发生过的历史。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"dreamcore-kuro-4\",\"name\":\"墟心域\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"ruins\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":311,\"y\":-225,\"brief\":\"碎裂平台与断续构架悬在幽暗中，仿佛被遗忘的念头留下的空壳。前进时需留心脚下连续的实体通路。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"dreamcore-kuro-5\",\"name\":\"沉心域\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"moon\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":-171,\"y\":14,\"brief\":\"深色机关墙收拢视野，低缓共振压住远处杂音，时间仿佛慢了下来。访客可在此整理思绪，也可能因沉湎而停步。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"dreamcore-kuro-6\",\"name\":\"心相迷宫\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"labyrinth\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":-378,\"y\":-266,\"brief\":\"层叠回廊与映像构成的迷宫，转角景象随心绪显得相似又陌生。应依当前可见的标记辨路，不把回忆映像认作本人。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"dreamcore-kuro-7\",\"name\":\"相心域\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"mirror\",\"parentName\":\"梦枢天罗\",\"x\":378,\"y\":266,\"brief\":\"交错光影在构架间形成不同轮廓，同一景象从不同角度观看便有不同含义。此处适合呈现心相之间的联系与分歧。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]}],\"edges\":[{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-1\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-5\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-1\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-6\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-5\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-2\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-3\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-3\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-7\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"dreamcore-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"dreamcore-kuro-4\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true}]}},{\"mapData\":{\"title\":\"隐海试验场\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-0\",\"name\":\"隐海试验场\",\"type\":\"laboratory\",\"iconType\":\"laboratory\",\"parentName\":\"隐海试验场\",\"x\":-13,\"y\":-23,\"brief\":\"海底的公共声骸培育、回收与研究区域，可使用特殊探索工具进行调律、改变事物状态。不同区域的开放与修复情况随主线阶段变化。\",\"地点资料\":\"涌明高塔：试验场中心的控制高塔，调律着各区域的运转。塔内记录、提灯与更深处的研究并非一般访客能够自由接触。\\n\\n千殁沉岛：嵌在海底峡谷中的声骸回收区，留有废弃培育舱；故障声骸在此分解、熔炼，回收的频率能量送往其他区域。\\n\\n生灵显地：公共声骸的培育、生产区域，大量培育舱集中于此，承接从回收频率到新生声骸的生产环节。\\n\\n蓄能中枢：试验场的能量储存与分配中心，回收的声骸频率先在此存储，再送往培育区；地下设施状态以实际调查为准。\\n\\n朝拜圣所：供海底教士朝拜的广场。信仰活动与试验区域分开，教士的经历及深层实验真相需通过剧情调查获知。\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-1\",\"name\":\"千殁沉岛\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"ruins\",\"parentName\":\"隐海试验场\",\"x\":378,\"y\":-86,\"brief\":\"嵌在海底峡谷中的声骸回收区，留有废弃培育舱；故障声骸在此分解、熔炼，回收的频率能量送往其他区域。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-2\",\"name\":\"生灵显地\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"laboratory\",\"parentName\":\"隐海试验场\",\"x\":197,\"y\":47,\"brief\":\"公共声骸的培育、生产区域，大量培育舱集中于此，承接从回收频率到新生声骸的生产环节。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-3\",\"name\":\"蓄能中枢\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"energy\",\"parentName\":\"隐海试验场\",\"x\":-11,\"y\":-101,\"brief\":\"试验场的能量储存与分配中心，回收的声骸频率先在此存储，再送往培育区；地下设施状态以实际调查为准。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-4\",\"name\":\"朝拜圣所\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"temple\",\"parentName\":\"隐海试验场\",\"x\":-240,\"y\":-92,\"brief\":\"供海底教士朝拜的广场。信仰活动与试验区域分开，教士的经历及深层实验真相需通过剧情调查获知。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-5\",\"name\":\"涌明高塔\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"tower\",\"parentName\":\"隐海试验场\",\"x\":-378,\"y\":101,\"brief\":\"试验场中心的控制高塔，调律着各区域的运转。塔内记录、提灯与更深处的研究并非一般访客能够自由接触。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]}],\"edges\":[{\"source\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-3\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-2\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-2\",\"target\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-1\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-3\",\"target\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-4\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-4\",\"target\":\"hiddenlab-kuro-5\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true}]}},{\"mapData\":{\"title\":\"下层金库\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"vault-kuro-0\",\"name\":\"下层金库\",\"type\":\"bank\",\"iconType\":\"bank\",\"parentName\":\"下层金库\",\"x\":14,\"y\":73,\"brief\":\"埃弗拉德金库的地下馆藏区域，分布多座藏馆及声骸站台，可借声骸列车移动。参观、寄存与深层区域的权限分别处理。\",\"地点资料\":\"费舍塔：下层金库中醒目的塔楼地标，层叠平台间传来低沉机声，来往职员在塔下确认藏馆方向与交接安排。\\n\\n贵金属与艺术品藏馆：下层金库收藏贵金属与艺术作品的分馆，内部有上下层展区、楼梯与围栏，需区分展陈空间和实际可通行的路线。\\n\\n人才藏馆：金库内部较为安静的分馆，登记桌与卷柜沿廊排布，职员低声核对名录。\\n\\n声骸藏馆：地下金库内的声骸藏馆，立体展陈与通路交错，部分探索涉及展品、吊灯及升降设施。\\n\\n声骸站台：声骸列车停靠与换乘的站台，连着金库的馆藏运输体系。\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[\"地下金库\",\"埃弗拉德金库·馆藏区\",\"地下馆藏区\"]},{\"id\":\"vault-kuro-1\",\"name\":\"费舍塔\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"tower\",\"parentName\":\"下层金库\",\"x\":-135,\"y\":-101,\"brief\":\"下层金库中醒目的塔楼地标，层叠平台间传来低沉机声，来往职员在塔下确认藏馆方向与交接安排。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"vault-kuro-2\",\"name\":\"贵金属与艺术品藏馆\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"bank\",\"parentName\":\"下层金库\",\"x\":134,\"y\":267,\"brief\":\"下层金库收藏贵金属与艺术作品的分馆，内部有上下层展区、楼梯与围栏，需区分展陈空间和实际可通行的路线。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[\"贵金属与艺术品藏区\"]},{\"id\":\"vault-kuro-3\",\"name\":\"人才藏馆\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"library\",\"parentName\":\"下层金库\",\"x\":195,\"y\":-267,\"brief\":\"金库内部较为安静的分馆，登记桌与卷柜沿廊排布，职员低声核对名录；馆内用途与权限以当前接洽为准。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[]},{\"id\":\"vault-kuro-4\",\"name\":\"声骸藏馆\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"facility\",\"parentName\":\"下层金库\",\"x\":149,\"y\":100,\"brief\":\"地下金库内的声骸藏馆，立体展陈与通路交错，部分探索涉及展品、吊灯及升降设施；不能凭图上邻近直接跨层。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[\"声骸藏区\"]},{\"id\":\"vault-kuro-5\",\"name\":\"声骸站台\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"iconType\":\"waystation\",\"parentName\":\"下层金库\",\"x\":-195,\"y\":174,\"brief\":\"声骸列车停靠与换乘的站台，连着金库的馆藏运输体系。列车通往哪些区域以及是否准许搭乘，依当期任务与授权处理。\",\"地点资料\":\"\",\"detailMap\":\"\",\"aliases\":[\"声骸车站\"]}],\"edges\":[{\"source\":\"vault-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"vault-kuro-4\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"vault-kuro-4\",\"target\":\"vault-kuro-2\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"vault-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"vault-kuro-1\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"vault-kuro-0\",\"target\":\"vault-kuro-5\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true},{\"source\":\"vault-kuro-1\",\"target\":\"vault-kuro-3\",\"type\":\"route\",\"label\":\"\",\"schematic\":true}]}}];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_0=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[0];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_1=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[1];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_2=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[2];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_3=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[3];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_4=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[4];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_5=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[5];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_6=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[6];window.SOLARIS_LAYER_7=window.__SOLARIS_LAYERS__[7];window.MAP_JSON_DATA=window.SOLARIS_LAYER_0;<\/script>\n  \n  <style>\n    * {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(80% 60% at 42% 42%, rgba(46, 138, 214, 0.09) 0%, transparent 55%),\n        radial-gradient(55% 45% at 74% 44%, rgba(124, 92, 208, 0.08) 0%, transparent 55%),\n        radial-gradient(50% 40% at 16% 34%, rgba(24, 158, 144, 0.08) 0%, transparent 55%),\n        radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, #f5f7fa 0%, #e3e9f1 48%, #d4dde8 100%);\n      color: #1e2a3c;\n    }\n\n    /* Faint topographic contour lines */\n    body::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: fixed;\n      inset: 0;\n      z-index: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      opacity: 0.6;\n      background-image:\n        radial-gradient(closest-side at 42% 44%, transparent 0 30%, rgba(90, 120, 160, 0.05) 31% 32%, transparent 33%),\n        radial-gradient(closest-side at 42% 44%, transparent 0 45%, rgba(90, 120, 160, 0.04) 46% 47%, transparent 48%),\n        radial-gradient(closest-side at 74% 46%, transparent 0 30%, rgba(90, 120, 160, 0.045) 31% 32%, transparent 33%),\n        linear-gradient(rgba(90, 115, 150, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(90, 115, 150, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(rgba(80, 105, 145, 0.09) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(80, 105, 145, 0.09) 1px, transparent 1px);\n      background-size:\n        auto, auto, auto,\n        34px 34px, 34px 34px,\n        170px 170px, 170px 170px;\n    }\n\n    /* Soft inner-shadow frame */\n    body::after {\n      content: '';\n      position: fixed;\n      inset: 0;\n      z-index: 1;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      background: rgba(45, 65, 95, 0.025);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 160px rgba(70, 95, 135, 0.2);\n    }\n\n    /* Slightly deepen only the map backdrop in compact embedded viewports. */\n    @media (max-width: 720px), (max-height: 520px) {\n      body::after {\n        background: rgba(45, 65, 95, 0.05);\n        box-shadow: inset 0 0 110px rgba(55, 78, 112, 0.24);\n      }\n    }\n\n    #map-container {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      z-index: 2;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      cursor: grab;\n    }\n\n    #map-container.grabbing {\n      cursor: grabbing;\n    }\n\n    #edge-canvas {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    #node-layer {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .node-wrapper {\n      position: absolute;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n      transition: filter 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .node-wrapper:hover {\n      filter: brightness(1.05) drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(40, 70, 110, 0.28));\n    }\n\n    .node-icon svg {\n      display: block;\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(40, 65, 100, 0.28));\n    }\n\n    /* ============ FLAT ICON DISCS (light-modern) ============ */\n    .node-icon {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 2;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: var(--nc, #6b7d94);\n      background: #fff;\n      border: 2px solid var(--nc, #6b7d94);\n      box-shadow: 0 3px 9px -2px rgba(40, 65, 100, 0.28), inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n    }\n\n    /* major (city/campus/stronghold): solid colored disc, white glyph */\n    .node-wrapper[data-tier=\"major\"] .node-icon {\n      color: #fff;\n      background: var(--nc, #2f7fd6);\n      border-color: #fff;\n      box-shadow: 0 5px 14px -3px var(--nc, #2f7fd6), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n    }\n\n    .node-wrapper[data-tier=\"major\"] .node-icon::after {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: -5px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      border: 1.5px solid var(--nc, #2f7fd6);\n      opacity: 0.32;\n    }\n\n    /* scene: tiny colored dot (icon glyph hidden) */\n    .node-wrapper[data-type=\"scene\"] .node-icon {\n      border: 2px solid #fff;\n      background: var(--nc, #6b7d94);\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px -1px rgba(40, 65, 100, 0.5);\n    }\n\n    .node-wrapper[data-type=\"scene\"] .node-icon svg {\n      display: none;\n    }\n\n    /* otherspace: keep the original ornate colored icon, no white disc */\n    .node-wrapper[data-type=\"otherspace\"] .node-icon {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      box-shadow: none;\n    }\n\n    .node-wrapper[data-type=\"otherspace\"] .node-icon svg {\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 5px rgba(80, 30, 110, 0.4));\n    }\n\n    .node-label {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 3;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #1e2a3c;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(110, 132, 165, 0.28);\n      padding: 2px 9px;\n      border-radius: 7px;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px -2px rgba(40, 65, 100, 0.22);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(3px);\n    }\n\n    /* City/Campus/Stronghold emphasis */\n    .node-wrapper[data-tier=\"major\"] .node-icon svg {\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 6px rgba(40, 65, 100, 0.32));\n    }\n\n    .node-wrapper[data-tier=\"major\"] .node-label {\n      color: #14203a;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    /* ============ DETAIL MODAL STYLES ============ */\n    .detail-overlay {\n      display: none;\n      position: fixed;\n      inset: 0;\n      z-index: 200;\n      background: rgba(60, 85, 120, 0.28);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .detail-overlay.active {\n      display: flex;\n    }\n\n    .detail-panel {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 90%;\n      max-width: 680px;\n      max-height: 85vh;\